bMed:19805282). In vitro, cytoplasmic tRNA(Gln) is slightly glutamylated, but with low activity (PubMed:19805282)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}